#: src/accounts/components/AccountsRemoveDialog.svelte:30
msgid ""
"Everything in this account is on this device alone and is deleted with it. "
"This cannot be undone. To keep it, sign up or log in first and move it into "
"your account."
msgstr ""
"Todo lo de esta cuenta está solo en este dispositivo y se elimina con ella. "
"No se puede deshacer. Para conservarlo, regístrate o inicia sesión primero y "
"muévelo a tu cuenta."

